ainted Realms (DEMO)", "keywords": ["cozy", "painting", "wholesome", "art", "sandbox"], "long_description": "# Join the Restorers !\n\nIn the magical Coquelicot Museum, paintings are portals towards living worlds ! Play as an art restorer and use your brushes to save the painted realms from a mysterious Eraser Artist.\n\n**Immersive art** - Rediscover the most famous paintings as immersive 3D worlds\n{2020461498710789}\n\n**Restoration** - Find the differences between the flat originals and the immersive paintings and paint everything back to normal\n{854306483740831}\n\n**Creative freedom** - Help the visitors of the museum with creative quests and wake up your inner artist\n{1376429067462623}\n\n**Sandbox** - Customize the museum with fun and easy to use art tools, such as the magical brush that turns 2D drawings into 3D objects !\n{1562077004939594}\n\n\n# Demo vs. Full Game\n\nThis demo version is a short, first-taste of the complete game. Here what you can expect from the full game :\n\n**More content** - The full game will be a 5-hour long adventure : explore multiple museum galleries and immersive paintings ; meet new inhabitants of the painted realms and complete dozens of creative quests.\n\n**New Social mode** - Invite your friends in your museum with the multiplayer mode, show your art and paint together ! Share your creations easily with social media integrations.\n\n**More creative tools** - More fancy brushes, a color-swap gun, a magic drawing machine... It'll be easier and funnier to customize your museum and to do the creative side quests.\n\n\nJoin us on Discord : https://discord.gg/dH8uKv7tm7\n\n", "short_description": "Play as an art restorer in the magical Coquelicot Museum. Step inside famous paintings and save them from a mysterious Eraser Artist..."}]}, "developer_name": "wondie games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wondiegames.com/#privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AIO Games", "support_webs